          "path": "implementations/rust/src/.dev/feature.json",
          "entityId": "month-end"
        }
      ],
      "criteria": [
        "CivilDate::of creates 5 November 2026, 29 February 2024 and 2000, +275760-09-13 and -0500-03-01",
        "CivilDate::of refuses 30 February and 29 February in 2026 and 1900 with day-out-of-range, and month 13 with month-out-of-range",
        "CivilDate::parse reads 2026-11-05 and answers invalid (day-out-of-range) for 2026-02-30",
        "day_of_week is Thursday and iso_week 45 for 5 November 2026; is_leap_year agrees with chrono for every kind of year",
        "add_days crosses a month end; days_until counts the days from 5 November to 25 December as chrono does; < orders dates",
        "add_months and add(Period) answer none (month-end) for 31 January + 1 month; add_months_constrained gives 28 February",
        "NaiveDate::try_from answers out-of-native-range for a year beyond chrono's range",
        "CivilYearMonth::of makes a month without a day, and add_months carries into the next year"
      ],
      "checks": [
