          "entityId": "no-local-zone"
        }
      ],
      "criteria": [
        "CivilTime::of writes 09:30 with no seconds, and of_hms writes them",
        "CivilDateTime::of makes a wall-clock date-time with no zone; of_hms refuses second 60 with leap-second",
        "add_hours carries 23:30 + 2 hours into the next day",
        "in_zone keeps the wall time and the zone; at_offset pins the wall time to the offset",
        "FixedOffsetDateTime round-trips DateTime<FixedOffset> exactly, and to_instant gives the UTC moment",
        "utv::parse answers an Instant for ...Z and a FixedOffsetDateTime for ...+00:00",
        "interop::chrono::from_local answers unsupported (local-zone) for any DateTime<Local>"
      ],
