        "add(PosixSeconds) moves by exactly those seconds; add_elapsed answers unsupported (needs-leap-seconds)",
        "Period::days(1) is not 86,400 seconds and Period::months(1) writes P1M",
        "ElapsedSeconds holds 90 minutes, and 86,400 SI seconds are neither a calendar day nor POSIX seconds"
      ],
